    {
      "id": "claim_526e8eb2305a41a3a940616799752542",
      "statement": "The system authenticates inbound clients via an OWS1 HMAC-SHA256 signing scheme in ClientAuthorizationHandler, validating required X-OP-* headers (Accept, X-OP-Date, X-OP-Expires, X-OP-Authorization), matching region, service, type, and algorithm against static server configuration, then recomputing the signature from the canonical request and an access-key secret before allowing rc.next().",
