    {
      "id": "claim_8d23bddc94984f51bca561859202721c",
      "statement": "Outbound KBank payloads are protected by AES-GCM encryption using a per-request UUID IV and a filesystem-based AES key, and signed with RSA/SHA-256 using the connector's private key; responses are decrypted and their signature verified with KBank's public key before the gateway inspects response body contents.",
